<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>RLRS Studio — 把想法做成真正好用的工具</title>
    <meta name="description" content="RLRS Studio 是一个独立工作室，专注于开发纯粹、本地优先的极客桌面软件。" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#07090f" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body data-nav="home">
    <main class="page" style="padding-top: 120px;">
        <section class="hero" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px;">
            <div class="badge">✦ 独立极客工作室</div>
            <h1 class="tagline">把想法，做成真正好用的工具。</h1>
            <div class="brand-full" style="margin-bottom:14px">LOCAL-FIRST · SERVERLESS</div>
            <p class="desc" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">拒绝臃肿与云端绑架，只用极致的代码与算力，死磕底层的稳定与体验。</p>
        </section>

        <h2 class="section-title reveal" id="projects">— 产品矩阵 —</h2>
        <div class="grid reveal" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); margin-bottom: 60px;">
            <a href="https://chert-launcher.github.io" target="_blank" class="product-card">
                <div class="icon">⛏️</div>
                <h3>Chert <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-2)">燧石启动器</span></h3>
                <div class="platform">Game Tool / Active</div>
                <div class="desc">硬核的 Minecraft 启动终端。内置 P2P 打洞联机、自愈 HUD 与四套 UI 设计语言。</div>
                <span class="status-badge ready">● 已发布 · 2.5.6</span>
            </a>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="icon">🖥️</div>
                <h3>Granite <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-2)">极客开服器</span></h3>
                <div class="platform">Server Tool / In Dev</div>
                <div class="desc">坚如花岗岩的服务端管理面板。一键拉取核心、可视化编辑配置与崩溃自动重启。</div>
                <span class="status-badge">核心开发中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="icon">💽</div>
                <h3>Basalt <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-2)">虚拟磁盘</span></h3>
                <div class="platform">System Utility / In Dev</div>
                <div class="desc">坚如磐石的现代虚拟磁盘管理器。完美支持 VHDX / VMDK，原生只读挂载与安全快照。</div>
                <span class="status-badge">核心开发中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="icon">🌐</div>
                <h3>Pumice <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-2)">P2P 联机网关</span></h3>
                <div class="platform">Network Tool / Planning</div>
                <div class="desc">基于自研 UDP 打洞技术的纯本地联机利器。脱离启动器限制，任何 TCP/UDP 端口一键映射。</div>
                <span class="status-badge">概念规划中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="icon">🧪</div>
                <h3>Cobalt <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-2)">化学实验室</span></h3>
                <div class="platform">Simulation / In Dev</div>
                <div class="desc">以深邃钴蓝为灵感的化学模拟工具。可视化反应过程与试剂操作，让实验安全且反复进行。</div>
                <span class="status-badge">核心开发中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="icon">💎</div>
                <h3>Geode <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-2)">开发者浏览器</span></h3>
                <div class="platform">Dev Browser / Planning</div>
                <div class="desc">基于 Rust 打造的极简浏览器，内置本地预览服务器与开发网站纯净模式。</div>
                <span class="status-badge">概念规划中</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/site-i18n.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
    <script src="/js/layout.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
    <script src="/js/particles.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
    <script src="/js/seasonal.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
    <script>
        document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => {
            const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
                entries.forEach((e) => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
            }, { threshold: 0.12 });
            io.observe(el);
        });
    </script>
    <script src="/festival-fx.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>